    "evidence": [
      "RU snapshot is an 11-day/10-night self-drive route: San Jose; Tortuguero on days 2–3; rental Mitsubishi ASX/Geely Cool Ray from day 4 to day 11; Arenal days 4–5, Monteverde days 6–7, Manuel Antonio days 8–10. Free days and car rental are defining services.",
      "2027 full DOCX comparison: Extreme Costa Rica (1Wi7mmVwAJ7XV7y0ZKmM1BevtWbcI_C7Z, word/document.xml paragraphs 75–90) is 13 days with Pacuare rafting/Cabecar, canyoning/ATV and North Pacific fishing/diving; no Manuel Antonio and no rental car. Treasures (1R4lP0kbZb6M7bXUL60IyZ1FOh2GppZ_W, paragraphs 67–104) is 10 days, adds Poas/Doka/La Paz on day 2, one Tortuguero night, Rio Celeste and guided Tarcoles/Manuel Antonio. Best of Costa Rica (1XgRrOBovEvh9uK-1gkdTHrVH0L8lMJYv, paragraphs 123–127) is 14 days with Corcovado/Cano Island and a domestic flight. None is the 11-day self-drive programme.",
      "2026 full DOCX comparison: Extreme (19vuuOuaM59Sb5_o2eCh_2X2MHjggg42n, paragraphs 60–103) repeats the 13-day rafting/North Pacific programme. Treasures (1WsY-yT1FgDBPtK7Gkq3xWgeKrUFCeBkb, paragraphs 45–86) is 10 days with Poas/Rio Celeste/Tarcoles and guided transport. Best (1PyTjmU0HZGkNO4Acq6YCOVAS5a7U8wsQ) is 14 days with Osa/Corcovado. 3 Glances and Costa Rica in 3 Steps are 10 days with six North Pacific nights and omit Tortuguero/Monteverde/Manuel Antonio. No equivalent self-drive route found.",
      "Expanded search inspected readable itinerary content of all 23 single-country Costa Rica Word programmes in the 2027/2026 manifests: Nature Lovers ends after Arenal (6d), Classic omits Tortuguero/Manuel Antonio (6d), Basic ends after Tortuguero/San Jose (5d), Caribbean Coast ends on south Caribbean beaches (10d), 5 Wonders/Beach & Mountain start Liberia/Rincon/Tenorio (9d), Authentic Jewels visits Corcovado/Cano (5d). Both VIP Costa Rica documents contain Luxury Costa Rica 2024, 16d with Corcovado/Pacific extensions and organised transfers. Multicountry and Costa Rica–Panama–Jamaica PDF are excluded by additional countries. No Costa Rica editionYearConflict source exists in manifest. Assigned 2026 candidate 12N1Jz70aGU0z4tQvUopLVB03tawbMJxw was read: Luxury Patagonia, Buenos Aires–Calafate–Torres del Paine–Santiago, not Costa Rica."
    ],
